  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dog Food for our 110+ Collie Dogs (Wales, UK)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are a registered charity who rescue, rehabilitate and rehome dogs (mainly border collies).  We are based in Wales, UK.    Our dogs live, play and have fun together in large packs.  Many of our dogs were due to be put to sleep from their owners after having no where else to turn.  Many were rejected from other rescues.  We have around 100 to 130 dogs. The majority are Collies or Collie crosses.</narrative>
  </description>
